    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the advice. i was worried i was just being paranoid but seeing it written out makes it feel so real. i also noticed that my access to the internal wiki was \"accidentally\" revoked yesterday right after i mentioned the payroll thing. it feels like they're cutting off my info so i can't prepare. what else should i be looking for that might show they're coordinating this?",
