      "content": "that's terrifying. the shift in tone thing actually just happened—my work friend marc sent me a super cold email about a spreadsheet instead of his usual jokes. it's like everyone's being instructed to treat me differently. if this is a coordinated effort to build a case against my mental health, do you think i should start looking for ways to show they're intentionally creating a hostile environment specifically to trigger me?",
